{
  "_comment": [
    "Recorded upstream cost per route for direct (non-OpenRouter) providers, USD per 1M tokens, before markup.",
    "Key: \u003cprovider\u003e/\u003cprovider_model_id\u003e from config.yaml -- cost follows where a request is sent, not our catalogue id.",
    "ref: OpenRouter model id + endpoint tag of the serving provider own standard tier; the pricing guard re-reads",
    "GET https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/models/\u003cref.openrouter\u003e/endpoints and refreshes in/out/cache with -live -update-ledger.",
    "Entries without ref are maintained by hand from the provider rate card named in source.",
    "internal/config/upstream_cost_floor_test.go fails make test if any model bills below these."
  ],
